    "detailed_description": "Astrotour VR is an exploration, adventure game for Virtual Reality (HTC Vive, Oculus Touch &amp; Quest). Experience full process to space, from astronaut registration to spaceship ride. Explore known but also unknown planets and receive as much information as possible!<br><br><strong>Main Features:</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/5605c92ab110ba35a07186e199ab3b69.poster.avif?t=1600878379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/5605c92ab110ba35a07186e199ab3b69.webm?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/5605c92ab110ba35a07186e199ab3b69.mp4?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>\u2022 Explore space with full interactive environment!</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/ade17110d10af372a432ce27096cb21c.poster.avif?t=1600878379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/ade17110d10af372a432ce27096cb21c.webm?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/ade17110d10af372a432ce27096cb21c.mp4?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>\u2022 Take the whole process from astronaut registration, through rocket preparation, rocket launch, to the planet observation!</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/3669af174ca1f120d43e53ccedb50ace.poster.avif?t=1600878379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/3669af174ca1f120d43e53ccedb50ace.webm?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/3669af174ca1f120d43e53ccedb50ace.mp4?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>\u2022 Explore bunch of interactive features in each room and level!</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/1dacdebf36542e300b616f1595d6cdfa.poster.avif?t=1600878379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/1dacdebf36542e300b616f1595d6cdfa.webm?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/1dacdebf36542e300b616f1595d6cdfa.mp4?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>\u2022 Take control of the flying rocket and defend your resources!</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/1c316c341b52b20554593089a3a037ff.poster.avif?t=1600878379\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/1c316c341b52b20554593089a3a037ff.webm?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416850/extras/1c316c341b52b20554593089a3a037ff.mp4?t=1600878379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>\u2022 Use special &amp; additional features like 3D printer or 3D pen!</i><br><br><strong>Other Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Simple, one-button &amp; user-friendly controls<br>\u2022 Various levels from astronaut\u2019s point of view<br>\u2022 Collection of planets and their characteristics<br>\u2022 Actions with aliens<br>\u2022 Rich voice over &amp; full narration<br>\u2022 Multi-language support<br>\u2022 Education and entertainment<br>\u2022 Ready for kids!",
